<title>USA: FGIC has capacity for Texas Turnpike Authority.</title>
<headline>FGIC has capacity for Texas Turnpike Authority.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said Monday it has secondary market insurance available on Texas Turnpike Authority Dallas North Tollway System revenue bonds.</p>
<p>Capacity is available first-come, first-served, FGIC said. For more information, call 212-312-3083 or 800-446-FGIC.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
